    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "narration_text": "Before acting on an aggregate KPI, ask which populations were combined, whether their baseline outcomes differ, and whether the pattern persists within relevant subgroups. Always ask what happens when the data is broken into the groups that actually matter.",
